---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { site } from '../data/site';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Featured slots | Airport Runways Live"
  description="Paid pin on the Airport Runways Live board. Your official YouTube channel, not a restream. We send you the view."
>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="wrap prose">
      <p class="eyebrow">Board product</p>
      <h1>Featured slots</h1>
      <p>
        Mid-size streamers can pin a listing on the live board. The pin sits under our MCO host card, gets a PIN badge,
        and stays an official YouTube link. We do not restream your picture. We send you the view.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>One card, labeled PIN, on /live and home featured</li>
        <li>Your channel URL, your Super Chats</li>
        <li>We can take the pin down if the stream is not a regular airport live</li>
        <li>Not a LIVE badge. LIVE still comes from the API cache</li>
      </ul>
      <p>
        This is how a mid-size channel pays the domain and the YouTube API project. Email
        {' '}<a href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Featured%20slot`}>{site.email}</a>
        with the channel URL, airports, and usual days.
      </p>
      <a class="btn btn-amber" href={`mailto:${site.email}?subject=Featured%20slot`}>Ask for a pin</a>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
